              "# Despite Tough Talk, U.S.-China Trade Negotiations Continue\nShipping containers in Oakland, Calif., earlier this month. Both the United States and China issued statements on Saturday saying their talks in recent days were productive.Credit...Justin Sullivan/Getty Images\n\nBy Keith Bradsher and Ana Swanson",
